nit.\n\nThe OpenAPI document and ADR-0041 describe `qu_id` but do not say whether `quantity_factor` multiplies the event quantity before or after the unit conversion. They also do not say whether the two may be combined.\n\n## To do\n\n- Document the rule in `victual.openapi.json` and the manual.\n- Add a fixture under `tests/fixtures/consumption-events/` for a mapping with both fields set. Read `services/ConsumptionMappingService.php` and the booking path to state the current behaviour before writing it down.\n","closed_by":{"login":"datagen24","id":20876965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODc2OTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20876965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/788/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/788/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}
